# data_test: only the new teleop capture is versioned, not lazy-downloaded assets.
# The broad "videos" rule above (and any other generic pattern) still matches
# nested paths under an un-ignored directory -- re-including the top-level
# dir isn't enough, every level needs re-including, hence the trailing /**.
data_test/*
!data_test/README.md
!data_test/teleop_decoupled_wbc
!data_test/teleop_decoupled_wbc/**
